WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
Oh my god, how could it be an embroidered sword?

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:03,960
no antibiotics

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,960
What should we do if infected?

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,120
It's all about you fighting us to attack Zhang Yi

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,800
The injured are all my relatives and friends

6
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,160
You and Lin Caining hid behind and were unharmed

7
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,880
Did you already know that he had a crossbow sword?

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,160
Buyi tricked us into dying

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,720
I really don't know

10
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:21,080
He didn't use his hand slave during the two previous visits.

11
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,930
Then why are you two the only ones not hurt at all?

12
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,010
I saw it clearly just now

13
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,570
The whole city is hiding away

14
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:31,730
Aren't you okay too?

15
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:33,650
Sorry to accuse us

16
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:36,750
Now the wounded need care

17
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,750
Let them work first

18
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,710
Bet you won't get infected

19
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,710
You can only go to Dr. Zhou Keer

20
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,390
He had saved Aunt Lin before

21
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:46,030
Experience in dealing with trauma
